#version 450

// GTAO with finite-thickness visibility sectors. Scalar visibility and bent
// normals integrate the SAME sector mask; both include distance falloff.
// Original sweep ported from SpartanEngine (license below). The depth guide,
// filtered mip sampling, sector moment integration and temporal path are engine code.
// Output: rgba16f, rgb = world bent normal, a = visibility (1 = unoccluded).
// References: Jimenez et al. 2016; Therrien et al. 2023 visibility bitmasks.
